The library `RiemannianGeometry` (directory RiemannianGeometry/) originates in a separate
formalisation project by the same author: the "Foundations" layer of a Lean formalisation
related to the work of P. Petersen and F. Wilhelm on exotic spheres, at commit ddc9fb9. It is
included here under the same licence. Changes made for this release:
  * module and namespace names (formerly `PetersenWilhelm.Foundations`, now `RiemannianGeometry`);
  * comments and docstrings: notes about that project's internal development process were
    removed.
No definition, statement or proof was changed.

The Lean code in both libraries was written by Claude (Anthropic) under the direction and
supervision of Fernando Galaz-García.
